<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>The Attorney General shall annually publish a report that includes information provided to the Registry of Charities and Fundraisers pursuant to Section 17510.9 for all charities reporting under that section. The report shall be made available to public main libraries in the state at no cost and to any person upon request and the payment of a reasonable fee to cover the costs of publication and distribution.</p></caml:Content>